# Use Cursor local tools

Implement with Cursor tools (Write, StrReplace, Shell, Task, etc.).

Do **not** route work through `.cursor/grok/run.sh`, force-grok hooks, or grok.com CLI quota. That force-router path is retired.

Optional quota CLIs (agy / opencode / kimi / grok) only when the user explicitly asks.
